Homepage: https://github.com/EmrHlix/usbnux
Description: GTK4 USB ISO writer, dumper and formatter
 USBnux is a GTK4/libadwaita desktop tool for writing Linux and
 Windows ISO images to USB drives, dumping a USB back to an ISO
 file, and formatting USB drives (FAT32 / NTFS / exFAT / ext4).
 Windows ISOs that exceed FAT32's 4 GiB limit are handled by
 splitting install.wim automatically.
